@page "/"
@layout LandingLayout

<PageTitle>Crawldad — declarative browser automation that doesn't rot</PageTitle>

@*
    Public marketing landing page. Static SSR only (no @rendermode): every interaction is a link or an in-page
    anchor, and the FAQ accordions are native <details>/<summary> — no JavaScript beyond what the vendored Tabler
    bundle already ships. Conversion CTAs ("Start free", "Sign in", "Choose <plan>") route to the existing OTP
    /login; section links are in-page anchors. Styling lives in wwwroot/marketing.css (linked by LandingLayout).
    Copy tracks docs/MARKETING.md (value-equation framing, personas, risk-reversal) and docs/BUSINESS_MODEL.md
    (Free / $99 Team / $499 Scale / Enterprise); webhooks and drift monitoring are shipped features and are
    presented as such.
*@

